{"version":1,"content":"<p>黑莓公司近日面向Windows平台推出全新企業級瀏覽器BlackBerry Access Secure Browser，旨在讓員工能夠在個人電腦上安全處理工作事務，同時避免企業完全接管整台設備。該產品基於Chromium開發，將黑莓的數據保護能力引入瀏覽器層面，並加入了此前已登陸iOS和Android平台的BlackBerry Access產品線，同時取代舊版BlackBerry Access桌面客户端。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587628.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.211349+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T09:08:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:13.166516+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:13.166516+00:00","content_hash":"b867260daa003ae06757eb9b932097193ded37b581464f7718e915d2d2f34c89","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}